    "version": "1",
    "description": "The first excel file: Correlation between ommatidia number and CS -Tibia length is about the Correlation between the ommatidia number and the CS, ommatidia number and tibia length. It shows the R2 values per strain. GWAS result Ommatidia corrected by CS: this file contains the GWAS results from ommatidia number corrected by CS values for a pvalue threshold of 1E-4 (results from Dgrpool https://dgrpool.epfl.ch/ ) GWAS result Ommatidia corrected by tibia length: this file contains the GWAS results from ommatidia number corrected by tibia length values for a pvalue threshold of 1E-4 (results from DGRP website tool) GWAS result PC1 corrected by CS: this file contains the GWAS results from wing shape (mean PC1) corrected by wing size (CS) values for a pvalue threshold of 1E-4 (results from Dgrpool https://dgrpool.epfl.ch/ ) GWAS result PC2 corrected by CS: this file contains the GWAS results from wing shape (mean PC2) corrected by wing size (CS) values for a pvalue threshold of 1E-4 (results from Dgrpool https://dgrpool.epfl.ch/ ) GWAS result- wing shape PC1: this file contains the GWAS results from wing shape (mean of PC1) for a pvalue threshold of 1E-4 (results from DGRP website tool) GWAS result-wing shape PC2: this file contains the GWAS results from wing shape (mean of PC2) for a pvalue threshold of 1E-4 (results from DGRP website tool) GWAS results-Tibia length: this file contains the GWAS results from leg size (tibia length) for a pvalue threshold of 1E-4 (results from DGRP website tool) GWAS result- ommatidia number: this file contains the GWAS results from ommatidia number for a pvalue threshold of 1E-4 (results from DGRP website tool) Ommatidia number data_162strains: phenotypic data of ommatidia number in 162 strains Tibia length -162 strains: phenotypic data of tibia length in 162 strains",
